<figure class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-2 border-ink p-4 sm:p-6">
<p class="font-bold">The shutter sorts gas molecules. The complete cycle includes its memory.</p>
<svg viewBox="0 0 480 237" class="w-full" role="img" aria-labelledby="maxwell-title maxwell-desc">
<title id="maxwell-title">A gas box partitioned by a shutter for fast and slow molecules</title><desc id="maxwell-desc">A gas box has a partition and a small doorway. Fast molecules pass one way and slow molecules the other. The demon needs to reset information to operate repeatedly.</desc>
