<figcaption class="text-base leading-normal">The scheme shows selective sorting, not a machine that produces free energy. The standard explanation counts the demon as part of the system: repeated measurement and resetting its memory have thermodynamic consequences. The precise scope of that explanation is debated.</figcaption></figure>